---
// src/components/home/WorkflowSection.astro
// Exact Pen.dev "Empat Pilar Filantropi" Descending 4-Card Staggered Waterfall
---

<section class="pen-philanthropy-section reveal-on-scroll" id="empat-pilar-filantropi">
  <div class="pen-philanthropy-container">
    <div class="pen-philanthropy-header">
      <div class="pen-header-left">
        <div class="pen-badge-pill">
          <div class="dot-halo">
            <div class="halo-ring"></div>
            <div class="core-dot"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="badge-text">Empat Pilar Filantropi</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="pen-section-title">
          Infaq, Sedekah, Zakat &amp; Wakaf:<br />
          Satu Pintu Kebaikan Berkelanjutan
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pen-header-right">
        <p class="pen-section-desc">
          Setiap pilar filantropi dikelola secara amanah, akuntabel, dan transparan — mewujudkan sarana ibadah, nutrisi, beasiswa santri vokasi, hingga kemanfaatan abadi.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pen-waterfall-grid">
      <div class="pen-pillar-card card-step-1">
        <div class="pen-pillar-thumb">
          <img
            src="/media-lp/WhatsApp Image 2026-10-05 at 09.22.04 (3).jpeg"
            alt="Infaq - Pengadaan Material Konstruksi Riil"
            class="pen-thumb-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pen-pillar-content">
          <h3 class="pen-pillar-title">Infaq</h3>
          <p class="pen-pillar-desc">
            Partisipasi pengadaan material konstruksi riil Masjid Khairu Ummah Sugro dan sarana workshop santri di Jonggol secara amanah dan terbuka.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pen-card-watermark" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pen-pillar-card card-step-2">
        <div class="pen-pillar-thumb">
          <img
            src="/media-lp/WhatsApp Image 2026-10-05 at 09.22.04 (2).jpeg"
            alt="Sedekah - Penyediaan Nutrisi Santri"
            class="pen-thumb-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pen-pillar-content">
          <h3 class="pen-pillar-title">Sedekah</h3>
          <p class="pen-pillar-desc">
            Penyediaan nutrisi sehat, konsumsi harian, dan gizi bagi santri vokasi serta para penghafal Al-Quran selama menempuh pendidikan.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pen-card-watermark" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pen-pillar-card card-step-3">
        <div class="pen-pillar-thumb">
          <img
            src="/media-lp/WhatsApp Image 2026-10-05 at 09.22.05 (1).jpeg"
            alt="Zakat - Penyaluran Hak Mustahik & Asnaf"
            class="pen-thumb-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pen-pillar-content">
          <h3 class="pen-pillar-title">Zakat</h3>
          <p class="pen-pillar-desc">
            Penyaluran kewajiban zakat 2,5% secara tepat sasaran kepada asnaf fi sabilillah dan beasiswa pendidikan vokasi santri dhuafa.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pen-card-watermark" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pen-pillar-card card-step-4">
        <div class="pen-pillar-thumb">
          <img
            src="/media-lp/WhatsApp Image 2026-10-05 at 09.22.06.jpeg"
            alt="Wakaf - Pengelolaan Aset Abadi 3 Ha"
            class="pen-thumb-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pen-pillar-content">
          <h3 class="pen-pillar-title">Wakaf</h3>
          <p class="pen-pillar-desc">
            Pengelolaan aset abadi seluas ±3 Ha di Jonggol untuk kawasan masjid, SMK Skill Village, dan agro-technopark berkelanjutan.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pen-card-watermark" aria-hidden="true">04</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pen-bottom-cta">
      <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu'alaikum%20Admin%20GVF,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20program%20filantropi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="pen-bottom-cta-link">
        Mulai Kebaikan Abadi Bersama Kami di Sukasirna Jonggol. Konsultasikan Program Gratis ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pen-philanthropy-section {
    position: relative;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 100px 0 120px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .pen-philanthropy-container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2.5rem;
  }

  /* Header Split Row */
  .pen-philanthropy-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 70px;
  }

  .pen-header-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .pen-badge-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 5px 14px 5px 10px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    box-shadow: 0px 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    border-radius: 32px;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .dot-halo {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .halo-ring {
    position: absolute;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(0, 107, 62, 0.12);
  }

  .core-dot {
    position: relative;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0969da;
  }

  .badge-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: normal;
    color: #000000;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .pen-section-title {
    font-size: 42px;
    line-height: 50px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .pen-header-right {
    max-width: 420px;
    padding-top: 50px;
  }

  .pen-section-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 25px;
    color: #62625b;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  /* 4-Card Waterfall Staggered Grid */
  .pen-waterfall-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .pen-pillar-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 0;
    background: transparent;
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
  }

  .pen-pillar-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
  }

  /* Staggered Vertical Offsets exact Pen.dev */
  @media (min-width: 1025px) {
    .card-step-1 {
      margin-top: 0px;
    }
    .card-step-2 {
      margin-top: 45px;
    }
    .card-step-3 {
      margin-top: 90px;
    }
    .card-step-4 {
      margin-top: 135px;
    }
  }

  /* Image Thumbnail */
  .pen-pillar-thumb {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    background-color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .pen-thumb-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
  }

  .pen-pillar-card:hover .pen-thumb-img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  /* Content */
  .pen-pillar-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .pen-pillar-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .pen-pillar-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 22px;
    color: #62625b;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  /* Big Faint Watermark Number at Bottom */
  .pen-card-watermark {
    font-size: 72px;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    margin-top: 24px;
    text-align: right;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  /* Bottom Kicker CTA */
  .pen-bottom-cta {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 90px;
  }

  .pen-bottom-cta-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #0969da;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .pen-bottom-cta-link:hover {
    color: #0752a8;
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .pen-philanthropy-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .pen-header-right {
      padding-top: 0;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .pen-waterfall-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .card-step-1, .card-step-2, .card-step-3, .card-step-4 {
      margin-top: 0 !important;
    }

    .pen-section-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      line-height: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pen-waterfall-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .pen-bottom-cta {
      margin-top: 60px;
    }
  }
</style>
